WEBVTT

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.350
Heh...

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.390
Look! She's really good-looking!

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.950
What's he talking about?

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.910
Here I am, Nami-san.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:35.820
Naim-san, your skin is
perfection incarnate.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:38.830
If your hand slips, you're dead.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.180
Yes.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.630
Hm?

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.400
Best vacation I ever had.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.400
That's fine, but don't forget that
we're wanted.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.910
Look at her, she's great!

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:54.110
What are you yapping about,
Luffy?

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.950
But just look at her!

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:58.790
We're in no hurry...

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.190
She's right.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:03.430
Our ship's so darn good looking.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.350
Luffy, what're you...

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.030
Going Merry!

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:17.430
Gotta love that flag!

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.510
Are you mad?!

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.030
She's been stolen!

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.380
No way! Stolen?!

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:23.630
Idiot!

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:26.470
You thief! Stop right there!

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:33.550
We got that ship from Kaya!

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.910
How dare you steal from a thief?!

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:42.390
Come back!

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:49.870
One Piece: The Movie
Adventures on Clockwork Island

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:02.910
Has it been a whole week?

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.390
Couldn't you find a better boat?

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:07.550
And clothes.

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:08.950
Don't complain!

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:12.390
That wedding rental was all
there was!

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:14.030
Where are we?

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:17.990
We don't know.
They took all our maps.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:21.190
- And my swords.
- And my shoes.

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:25.870
Dimwits! How can you think of
going out unprepared?

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.190
Help!

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.430
Look, a kid!

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:33.550
He's drowning. Let's go help him.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.950
Hey, are you all right?

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.350
Fooled ya!

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.270
Huh?

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.390
What the...!

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.190
Good work.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:02.200
No probs! These guys were
easily fooled.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.230
Damn kid!

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:08.670
But I didn't see any
money on them.

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:10.710
Well, that's just great.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.470
Poor folks, eh?

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.430
Who the hell are you?

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:18.070
Us?

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:22.790
We're the thief brothers who
hunt all treasure!

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.590
Borod!

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.830
And Akees!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.270
Thief brothers?

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.830
What now?

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.430
It's just rubble...

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.910
Heh, you're just failures.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.790
You know nothing about us!

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:48.350
We're going to steal the diamond
clock from Clockwork Island!

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.190
The Diamond Clock?!

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:51.390
What's that?

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:56.310
The world's best mechanical clock
with amazing jewels!

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.470
Nami-san, my love! You know all.

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:03.230
I guess taking that makes you
the King of Thieves.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:06.070
Hey, that's just like us.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.430
Eh?

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:10.270
I'm gonna be the King of Pirates!

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.350
King of Pirates?

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.710
- With this?
- Of course not!

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:18.950
Our ship was stolen
by some low-life loser!

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:23.830
Does your ship have
a straw hat mark on it?

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.230
You saw it?

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:28.390
Yeah. The Card Brothers had it.

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:29.590
Card Brothers?

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.630
It's a vile pirate band, who have
their base on Clockwork Island.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:39.070
They have the Diamond Clock
that I want, too.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.190
Unimpressive.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:45.710
Hey, I like these faces,
they look cool!

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.310
Look cool?
They stole your ship!

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:52.710
Aren't you mad?
Don't you wanna get them?

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:54.630
Borod, look!

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:57.350
What the...

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.830
The Card Pirates...

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.230
Hey! You there!

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:11.390
Hmm?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.710
A hot babe!

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:15.790
Now who are you guys?

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.590
Give us back our ship you stole!

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:21.550
I haven't seen your ship.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:22.870
Course you have!

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.350
Hm? Hey...

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.150
Time for a nice riddle.

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:30.350
Riddle?

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:34.070
Who will become the
King of Pirates?

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:38.150
Dear Boojack, that's the simplest
of questions.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.550
Me!

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:44.870
Wrong! It's our boss Bear King-sama,
who'll be the King.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.470
You don't know anything.

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:48.630
What?

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.950
It wasn't even a riddle.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.420
They're a bunch of losers.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:57.440
Are you making fools of
the Card Pirates?

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:00.270
They obviously need a lesson.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:05.950
Here we go.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.190
I guess.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:08.640
Good luck!

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:11.350
Take this.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.590
Gum-Gum Pistol!

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.150
They're amazing! As I thought!

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.270
Oh dear. Who'd have thought?

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.430
Well done, Boojack!

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:36.950
- What's that?
- Something bad.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.590
Leave it to me.

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:41.140
Execute plan. Escape!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.430
Oh dear.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:55.230
Huh?

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.710
What was that?

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.270
I found it!

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:20.590
And now a riddle! What was it
that we wanted from you?

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.190
Nami-san!

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:25.830
Correct. So we will take her
with us.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.190
What?

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:30.270
She'll be a present to Bear King-sama.

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:35.460
And she will please us in all
thinkable ways...

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.070
All thinkable...ways?

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.630
Dammit!

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:01.110
Can we reach them in this?

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:05.910
You'll see. Borod can read
the wind like no one else!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.870
Don't brag, kid.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.750
They got Nami-san from us because
you dropped that whatever.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:16.390
We would've gotten away otherwise.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.750
Is that your treasure?

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:24.790
That music box is the only
homeland that Akees has.

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:26.550
Homeland?

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:40.070
When I found him, he was sleeping
in a crib with that music box.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:48.670
It was the only thing that could
comfort him.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:57.630
You're not real brothers?

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.710
Not in blood, but in soul.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:05.310
Yeah! I'm gonna be as cool a thief
as Borod, and live well.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:17.620
A maelstrom!

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:20.510
Yeah. We're closing in.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:28.190
So that's Clockwork Island...

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:42.310
So what'll it be? I'm going after
that Diamond Clock.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:46.830
You want your lass and your ship.
Same destination.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:50.510
Those lowly pirates that took Nami-san...

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:53.310
There we'll find Going Merry...

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:55.750
...and my swords.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:59.550
Then let's go to Card Castle...
together!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.590
Yeah!

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:12.870
What? Say that again!

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:16.270
You took this island 7 years ago.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:20.350
You've killed many with
the weapons we make.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:24.950
If you complete that awful
murderous machine...

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:28.630
We can't do this anymore!

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:34.510
Mayor. You do know

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:37.670
that we hold the ratchet key to this island?

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.910
You do know what happens if I...

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.230
remove it?

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:49.870
Good. Get them out of here.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.070
Yes, sir!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.380
Let me go! I can walk.

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:58.110
Once the King Cannon
is finished...

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:03.630
I, Bear King, will conquer the seas
and be King of Pirates!

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:11.070
Welcome home, Honey Queen.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:14.630
A young female! You took her?

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.110
Eeek!

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:22.430
This is not for you, Skunk One.
This is for Bear King-sama.

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:25.750
A bride candidate for me?

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:30.350
What?

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:33.110
I like her!

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:37.070
I... I want to marry you, please.

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:41.910
Fell in love at first sight?
Sorry, but I hate hairy men.

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:43.470
I can shave!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:45.150
And I hate weak men.

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.670
I'm strong!

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.950
But you can't defeat Luffy.

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.070
Luffy?

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:55.950
One of her crew, a strange guy
whose body is made of rubber.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:59.710
Might that be Straw Hat Luffy?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.190
That weakling is wanted?

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:07.630
I'd say, "caution is the eldest
child of winter."

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.310
Wisdom.

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:13.740
We must remain careful.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:17.270
We, careful? With this little runt?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:18.990
I got it!

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:23.470
I'll show you how strong I am.

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:28.910
The 30 million berries that are put
on this little rat's head...

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:32.670
...will be for our wedding party!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:38.190
Hahaaa! This is just so cool!

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:45.150
How'd they bother to build this?

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.350
It's a defence barrier.

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:51.750
Climbing those stairs, we'll soon be dead.

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:54.230
So, how're we getting up?

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.230
There's a central elevator.

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:03.430
Every evening, the hidden door
opens for them to get out, so...

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:04.950
Oh my god!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.790
Wait? Didn't you listen?
There are traps...

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:10.550
Like we care.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.350
Come on.

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:13.620
Sounds fun.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:15.950
Listen to Borod!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.430
A... Amazing!

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:58.420
Hurry up!

00:13:58.560 --> 00:13:59.630
Yeah...

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:24.990
And we're finally at the top!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.300
Wooooooow!

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:33.350
It's a tower! It's a town!
This is so cool!

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:44.350
What is this place?

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.630
This is Clockwork Town.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.270
And that's Card Castle?

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.710
I see the Diamond Clock!

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:03.400
Best mechanism in the world.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:05.550
And look there behind it.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.790
Eh? Huh?

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.430
It's Going Merry!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.870
- You see it?
- It's on top of that tower.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:18.110
It's so far away I can't see.

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:20.990
- Hey...
- Yeah?

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:23.630
You have good eyes.

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:26.070
Hm? Yeah, I guess...

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.710
- Damn...
- Hm?

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.980
- Feet hurt?
- I'm okay, don't bother.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:39.510
Okay! Let's go!

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:42.390
Smash into the Card Castle!

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.550
First we eat, then change.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.190
Wh...what?

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:52.510
Your crewmate is kidnapped,
and you just sit here eating?

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:54.230
Shouldn't you attack?

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:57.630
Nami will be fine on her own.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:00.550
Ah, this is much better.

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:06.830
That's it. You take the bill, eh?

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:10.470
- What?
- Here ya go. Do come again.

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:12.390
What?

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.870
Can we bargain a little?

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.990
- No.
- We're a bit short...

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.870
Not a chance.

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:22.870
Luffy, whaddaya doing here?

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.430
Hm?

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:28.190
This is really beautiful stuff.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:30.110
All clockwork?

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.110
What was that?

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:35.910
Clockwork...

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:37.310
Island...

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:38.750
ls a fun...

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:39.870
Island...

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:43.740
Outsiders. You know nothing
about this place.

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:50.710
This place used to be a dream.
The fun times have long since passed.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:57.670
We built this mechanical clock
to celebrate our child.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.710
The whole island rejoiced.

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:04.910
So you're the ones who built
the Diamond Clock!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:08.110
But since the Card Pirates came,

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:12.110
everyday has been hell for us.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:21.070
Nowadays, we only build weapons
that kill people.

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:28.710
If we protest, Bear King will
crush the island.

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:33.430
As long as he has the ratchet key,
we can do naught.

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:35.750
That's horrible!

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:39.870
That's all finished now.

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:44.510
These guys will smash the Card Pirates!

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:46.390
When did we say that?

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:51.510
We just wanna get our stuff!
Then we're leaving this place.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.310
Doesn't it make you mad?

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.790
Make you furious?

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:57.560
You gotta save this island!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.070
Save this island!

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:04.750
You're just saying that because
you wanna nick the Clock!

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:06.870
Hey!

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:12.190
Oh? Well, if you want, feel free
to steal the Clock.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:16.510
Seeing it just brings back
painful memories.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.390
But stealing it is impossible.

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:23.830
No one has ever succeeded at that.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:26.990
Borod can steal anything he wants!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.440
Yeah!

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:32.150
You don't know how dangerous
they are.

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:35.350
You must leave this instant.

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:36.800
Sorry, ma'am.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.830
We have our reasons.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.870
You have no future if you die!

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:45.120
Nor if you run away.

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:46.350
Eh?

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:53.310
Right?

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:54.470
Let's go!

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:55.590
Yeah!

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:57.310
Wait, Nami-san.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:59.710
- Ouch!
- What're you doing?

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:01.240
Come, Akees!

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:02.510
Yes!

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.910
But...

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:10.670
Huh?

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:18.630
Did he call him "Akees"

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:29.070
And I win again! So sorry, guys.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:33.910
She's going to make us lose
everything!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:37.350
Why don't they come
to try and save you?

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:40.200
The traps must've got them.

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:43.470
It'd be easier if they were that weak.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:47.070
Out of the frying pan...
into the fryer.

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:49.750
It's "fire".

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:55.430
I'll go and check up on them.

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:59.990
Running away, are you?
You owe me quite a lot.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.990
You can pay with your body!

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:09.470
What?

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:15.470
Let's go!

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:21.150
<i>Don't tell me she's...</i>

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:31.950
Cool! It's like an aeroplane!

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:36.240
Watch out, there's a
minefield below us!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:42.910
Hey, look at those windmills.

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:44.390
Eh?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:47.390
They're identical.

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:49.310
It must be from here.

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:51.070
It's broken.

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:52.470
Give it to me.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:04.910
Wow, you're pretty good
at this kinda stuff!

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:09.790
He's amazing! He can repair
pretty much everything.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.800
There. Fixed.

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:18.030
Cool!

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:20.510
Wow, you're great!

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:24.030
Oh dear, are you still alive?

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:32.980
It's that hot babe!
I gotta see her again!

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:34.190
Calm down.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:35.670
What was that?!

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:37.510
Devil Fruit powers.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:39.070
Correct!

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:40.830
Liquid fruit.

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:44.470
Boojack, give them their prize.

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:47.990
Yes! Come to me!

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:57.470
- Sanji!!
- Right in his foot!

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:05.270
Hold it right there.

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:06.750
I say!!

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:19.790
Sanji!

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:26.350
Sanji-kun!

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:29.590
Nami-san... I'm sorry.

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:30.830
Sanji-kun!

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:33.270
Look, I spared his life.

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:36.590
That's how much I love you.

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:41.430
I see now. Yes, I really prefer
strong men like you.

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:42.590
Yes!

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:45.270
But I need more time to think...

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:47.190
- I understand.
- So don't kill...

00:22:47.320 --> 00:22:48.350
Skunk One!

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:51.350
Sir! I will convince her!

00:22:51.560 --> 00:22:55.470
- No! I said don't kill...!
- Now, let's play.

00:23:02.200 --> 00:23:06.270
Damn it all! If only I had
my slingshot...

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:08.990
You wouldn't dare to anyway!

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:10.110
What?

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:14.830
Borod would save me even if
he lost both feet!

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:17.560
Your hand...

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:18.870
Did you...

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.900
Yup, he always protects me,
risking his life for me!

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:27.470
You brag about being saved?

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:32.270
I'm just a kid,
and I'm still weak, so...

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:35.590
It's not a question about

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:38.390
being weak or not!

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:40.430
Stop it. That's enough.

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:45.470
It's not! I hate brats who think
they'll always be saved!

00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:47.150
As if I care!

00:23:47.360 --> 00:23:48.950
What'd you say?!

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:57.710
Okay... let's go!

00:23:57.840 --> 00:24:00.590
Hey kid. You can go home.

00:24:00.720 --> 00:24:01.860
What?!

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:05.310
Well, I'm not saving a weakling.

00:24:06.280 --> 00:24:08.470
I'm not going home!

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:10.870
Okay. Then fight!

00:24:12.080 --> 00:24:14.870
Gum-Gum Pistol!

00:24:16.200 --> 00:24:17.550
Come on!

00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:19.830
Oh crap!

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:22.590
I'll take them!

00:24:23.440 --> 00:24:25.950
There's too many of them.

00:24:26.520 --> 00:24:27.910
Leave 'em to me!

00:24:40.560 --> 00:24:42.910
Roronoa Zoro...

00:24:45.960 --> 00:24:47.630
- Ooh!
- What?

00:24:51.640 --> 00:24:55.390
So my doomsday weapon is
finally done!

00:24:55.800 --> 00:24:57.830
All hail the great Bear King-sama!

00:24:57.960 --> 00:25:00.910
Much better than our last boss!

00:25:01.120 --> 00:25:05.870
The King Cannon has finally
been completed!

00:25:06.280 --> 00:25:08.070
The spicing on the cake.

00:25:08.200 --> 00:25:09.550
"Icing", you mean?

00:25:10.640 --> 00:25:11.670
King Cannon.

00:25:11.800 --> 00:25:12.990
Is that it?

00:25:13.160 --> 00:25:15.950
The legend about me has begun!

00:25:16.040 --> 00:25:19.430
I'll be the King of all Pirates!

00:25:22.520 --> 00:25:23.510
Sanji-kun!

00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:26.110
I'm sorry... Nami-san.

00:25:26.280 --> 00:25:28.950
Don't worry.
They're dumb, so I can...

00:25:29.080 --> 00:25:30.590
No, you can't.

00:25:30.720 --> 00:25:31.710
Eh?

00:25:31.800 --> 00:25:34.550
I just wanted to save you...

00:25:34.640 --> 00:25:36.990
by myself.

00:25:38.680 --> 00:25:39.790
And...

00:25:40.120 --> 00:25:43.510
then be hugged by you as thanks,

00:25:43.600 --> 00:25:47.150
followed by this and that and...

00:25:47.280 --> 00:25:48.310
You creep.

00:25:48.640 --> 00:25:52.070
Who are you to my fiancee?

00:25:52.360 --> 00:25:56.510
The one who rubs suntan lotion
all over her back.

00:25:56.640 --> 00:26:00.230
What?! Crucify this creep!

00:26:00.360 --> 00:26:05.150
He might be of her crew,
but I'm gonna kill him!

00:26:10.720 --> 00:26:12.270
Watch your mouth.

00:26:12.360 --> 00:26:17.190
You weaklings have no chance against us.

00:26:17.320 --> 00:26:22.550
You'll regret those words before
the day is over...

00:26:34.640 --> 00:26:36.870
What's this stench?

00:26:39.440 --> 00:26:44.150
Welcome to Card Castle.
Your friend is waiting.

00:26:44.320 --> 00:26:45.390
What?

00:26:49.760 --> 00:26:50.830
Sanji!

00:26:51.960 --> 00:26:55.270
He made Bear King-sama a bit angry.

00:26:55.400 --> 00:26:58.550
So we crucified him a little.

00:27:00.520 --> 00:27:01.590
What's this?

00:27:01.720 --> 00:27:06.920
Devil's gas! One breath, and you'll
turn into a powerless lump.

00:27:07.200 --> 00:27:10.150
Have fun holding your breath!

00:27:10.280 --> 00:27:13.470
You're kidding me!
We can't just...

00:27:13.760 --> 00:27:14.750
Luffy!

00:27:14.840 --> 00:27:17.830
- I don't wanna do anything...
- Get a grip!

00:27:24.400 --> 00:27:28.990
Akees, you said I didn't have
the guts to do anything, right?

00:27:29.160 --> 00:27:31.620
Take a look at this, brat!

00:27:31.760 --> 00:27:35.910
Behold Usopp when he does
his amazing cool stunts!

00:27:38.040 --> 00:27:39.710
Usopp!

00:27:42.360 --> 00:27:44.740
- Lemme go!
- Dream on!

00:27:45.400 --> 00:27:46.540
That idiot...

00:27:46.680 --> 00:27:50.380
Leave this guy to me!
Just go!

00:27:54.040 --> 00:27:55.630
Now eat that!

00:27:58.600 --> 00:28:00.430
- Usopp!
- Come, Akees!

00:28:00.560 --> 00:28:01.550
But...

00:28:01.640 --> 00:28:05.630
Don't let his bravery be in vain!
Hurry up!

00:28:15.000 --> 00:28:17.830
I can't believe that he's alive.

00:28:17.960 --> 00:28:18.950
Usopp!

00:28:20.240 --> 00:28:21.950
Do you care about him?

00:28:22.080 --> 00:28:24.150
Or course! He's one of us!

00:28:24.360 --> 00:28:29.230
You should care about me alone.
Crucify this guy too!

00:28:29.560 --> 00:28:30.550
Yes, sir!

00:28:40.800 --> 00:28:42.510
What are you doing?

00:28:42.680 --> 00:28:46.110
Don't spoil your dress, m'lady.

00:28:46.240 --> 00:28:48.910
And mind your manners.

00:29:10.800 --> 00:29:12.230
Look there!

00:29:14.320 --> 00:29:15.910
Usopp!

00:29:27.240 --> 00:29:28.590
What's this?

00:29:28.720 --> 00:29:32.420
It's the mechanism
protecting this island.

00:29:32.840 --> 00:29:34.750
Let's hurry!

00:29:37.320 --> 00:29:38.590
Akees!

00:29:42.600 --> 00:29:43.630
Akees!

00:29:52.160 --> 00:29:53.750
What's happening?

00:29:53.880 --> 00:29:55.100
Akees!

00:29:55.240 --> 00:29:58.470
I'm just dragging you down again.

00:29:58.600 --> 00:30:03.470
Don't give me that, Akees!
We're brothers, remember?

00:30:03.680 --> 00:30:05.510
It's so heavy!

00:30:05.640 --> 00:30:09.310
We can't hold it for long!
Borod, you gotta help us!

00:30:12.760 --> 00:30:13.750
What?

00:30:17.000 --> 00:30:20.390
Of all people. You disappoint me.

00:30:21.040 --> 00:30:24.790
Seems no one can fight
the Card Pirates.

00:30:24.920 --> 00:30:25.910
What?

00:30:26.000 --> 00:30:29.230
After I took your ship and all.

00:30:29.400 --> 00:30:32.040
You stole our ship?

00:30:32.320 --> 00:30:36.590
I thought something was fishy.
So it was you!

00:30:37.280 --> 00:30:40.070
You used us to get to the Clock!

00:30:40.200 --> 00:30:42.710
I'm not after some damn clock.

00:30:42.840 --> 00:30:43.870
What?

00:30:44.000 --> 00:30:47.350
I just wanted you to defeat these pirates,

00:30:47.440 --> 00:30:50.230
and save the island.

00:30:50.400 --> 00:30:52.110
B...but why?

00:30:52.360 --> 00:30:57.560
I wanted to return Akees to his
parents on this island.

00:30:57.680 --> 00:30:59.430
So this is his...

00:30:59.560 --> 00:31:02.150
His birthplace. I'm sure of it.

00:31:04.120 --> 00:31:05.950
Sorry for the trouble.

00:31:06.080 --> 00:31:10.150
And please take care of Akees,
should I die here.

00:31:11.400 --> 00:31:13.590
I have to fight them.

00:31:13.720 --> 00:31:16.710
Idiot! You don't stand a chance!

00:31:16.840 --> 00:31:18.870
I don't care.

00:31:18.960 --> 00:31:22.840
There's no future if you run away.

00:31:29.720 --> 00:31:30.990
Right?

00:31:31.560 --> 00:31:33.150
Borod!

00:31:33.600 --> 00:31:36.190
He's ready to die.

00:31:36.320 --> 00:31:38.830
Luffy, can't you do something?

00:31:39.000 --> 00:31:40.590
I'm afraid not.

00:31:41.080 --> 00:31:42.870
Who are you?

00:31:43.040 --> 00:31:45.500
Long time no see, Roronoa.

00:31:45.640 --> 00:31:49.590
I have not forgotten the scar
you gave me!

00:31:50.320 --> 00:31:51.790
You...

00:31:52.320 --> 00:31:53.510
Who're you?

00:31:53.640 --> 00:31:54.710
You don't know?

00:31:54.840 --> 00:31:58.150
Can't remember all
the weaklings I've beat.

00:31:58.560 --> 00:31:59.950
Agreed!

00:32:00.080 --> 00:32:04.350
I will teach you that
he who talks first, squalls first.

00:32:04.480 --> 00:32:05.800
"Falls first".

00:32:05.920 --> 00:32:07.240
Shut up and die!

00:32:08.080 --> 00:32:09.590
Featherdarts!

00:32:11.360 --> 00:32:12.950
What're you doing?!

00:32:14.200 --> 00:32:15.590
Zoro...you...!

00:32:17.640 --> 00:32:21.790
You lunatic!
You almost scared me.

00:32:24.680 --> 00:32:28.510
Sorry Luffy. This won't take long.

00:32:29.520 --> 00:32:30.840
Try it.

00:32:30.960 --> 00:32:36.390
Skunk's gas, and my poison darts...
Your body won't move.

00:32:36.640 --> 00:32:37.710
Damn.

00:32:41.440 --> 00:32:42.430
Zoro!

00:32:45.800 --> 00:32:48.360
Time to kick the one who's clown.

00:32:48.880 --> 00:32:52.150
"D...down."

00:32:53.480 --> 00:32:56.550
Zoro!

00:33:01.440 --> 00:33:03.350
What the hell's this?

00:33:09.480 --> 00:33:11.670
Where's the 30 million guy?

00:33:11.800 --> 00:33:13.710
He's been crushed by the trap.

00:33:13.840 --> 00:33:17.870
Bear King-sama doesn't even have to
fight to beat them!

00:33:18.000 --> 00:33:19.950
The marriage is sealed.

00:33:20.080 --> 00:33:23.750
We must start the preparations.

00:33:23.960 --> 00:33:29.160
And our main number will be
a test shot of the King Cannon!

00:33:33.840 --> 00:33:35.870
Right at those three!

00:33:36.320 --> 00:33:37.590
What?

00:33:39.920 --> 00:33:42.790
And you'll be the bride of the King.

00:33:42.920 --> 00:33:44.910
Aren't you happy?

00:33:47.080 --> 00:33:50.390
Who the hell has agreed
to marry you?

00:33:51.440 --> 00:33:55.140
Do you even understand
what you're saying?

00:33:55.320 --> 00:34:00.630
I'd rather die with them
than marry a creep like you!

00:34:02.760 --> 00:34:04.670
I'll fulfil that wish!

00:34:04.800 --> 00:34:09.430
We'll change tonight's party
into a funeral instead!

00:34:09.760 --> 00:34:11.950
Execute her too!

00:34:12.080 --> 00:34:13.630
Yes, sir!

00:34:16.480 --> 00:34:19.550
Luffy! Where did Borod go?

00:34:19.760 --> 00:34:21.790
He went after the Card Pirates!

00:34:21.920 --> 00:34:23.750
What? Borod!

00:34:23.920 --> 00:34:27.950
Hey, what about me?
Help me out!

00:35:26.920 --> 00:35:28.750
Who the hell are you?

00:35:31.600 --> 00:35:33.790
Sorry, pal.

00:35:33.880 --> 00:35:36.630
I took some of your fireworks.

00:35:36.720 --> 00:35:37.750
That voice...

00:35:37.840 --> 00:35:40.630
- Borod!
- He's gonna kill himself!

00:35:40.960 --> 00:35:44.790
This is how I play.
I'm taking you down with me!

00:35:45.320 --> 00:35:47.510
Are you utterly mad?

00:35:48.000 --> 00:35:50.990
You can't blow those up here!

00:35:51.720 --> 00:35:55.500
Look at this ratchet.
You know what it is?

00:35:55.680 --> 00:35:57.550
The island ratchet!

00:35:57.760 --> 00:36:02.910
If you blow up now, you'll crush
the whole island with you.

00:36:15.400 --> 00:36:17.110
Borod!

00:36:27.680 --> 00:36:30.110
Like a cloth to a flame.

00:36:30.480 --> 00:36:32.790
"Moth" to a flame.

00:36:39.360 --> 00:36:43.060
Don't... don't you touch Borod!

00:36:43.320 --> 00:36:44.910
Akees!

00:36:45.000 --> 00:36:47.430
You little brat!

00:36:58.960 --> 00:37:00.310
It's him.

00:37:34.200 --> 00:37:35.670
What's happening?

00:37:42.560 --> 00:37:44.310
Finally here!

00:37:51.520 --> 00:37:52.950
What's going on?

00:37:53.640 --> 00:37:54.710
Card Castle?

00:37:54.840 --> 00:37:55.910
Hurry up!

00:37:57.200 --> 00:37:58.590
It's them.

00:38:04.200 --> 00:38:05.270
Luffy!

00:38:05.400 --> 00:38:07.070
Finally!

00:38:07.200 --> 00:38:08.270
Luffy!

00:38:08.800 --> 00:38:10.230
You're late.

00:38:10.360 --> 00:38:12.470
So you're Straw Hat Luffy?

00:38:12.600 --> 00:38:15.270
Where are all the others?

00:38:17.480 --> 00:38:19.550
I found something fun!

00:38:19.680 --> 00:38:21.630
- What?!
- No! Idiot!

00:38:21.920 --> 00:38:24.750
What? I should drop it?

00:38:24.960 --> 00:38:25.950
Okay.

00:38:37.760 --> 00:38:40.030
Have you seen my crew?

00:38:40.160 --> 00:38:41.950
You just blew them up!

00:38:42.080 --> 00:38:43.070
I what!?

00:38:47.440 --> 00:38:50.430
Luffy! You're freaking mad!

00:38:50.560 --> 00:38:54.030
Whatever. It got us out of there.

00:38:54.160 --> 00:38:56.230
Yep. That's right.

00:38:56.400 --> 00:38:57.540
Oh. You're okay.

00:38:57.680 --> 00:38:58.790
No thanks to you!

00:39:04.400 --> 00:39:05.510
Usopp!

00:39:11.600 --> 00:39:16.510
Don't you touch her, riddle creep!
I'll kick you to hell!

00:39:16.720 --> 00:39:19.070
Oh, I'm shaking in my boots!

00:39:19.240 --> 00:39:22.150
Kick me with those puny feet?

00:39:23.200 --> 00:39:24.340
Why you...

00:39:24.440 --> 00:39:26.750
Hey, who did that?!

00:39:28.240 --> 00:39:29.270
Usopp!

00:39:30.880 --> 00:39:32.390
Eat this! Egg Star!

00:39:33.840 --> 00:39:35.110
It stinks!

00:39:35.240 --> 00:39:38.790
It's a bloody rotten egg!
I hate stinkers!

00:39:38.920 --> 00:39:40.060
Says you!

00:39:40.200 --> 00:39:41.830
I'll get you!

00:39:42.480 --> 00:39:44.470
Zoro! Catch these!

00:39:46.640 --> 00:39:47.860
Thanks!

00:39:54.920 --> 00:39:58.430
You try to slash one
with his back turned?

00:40:02.520 --> 00:40:05.830
Gum-Gum Gatling!

00:40:09.400 --> 00:40:11.670
- What?
- It's not working.

00:40:12.880 --> 00:40:16.110
My body is made of steel, you know.

00:40:16.240 --> 00:40:19.870
A wobbly rubber guy like you
doesn't stand a chance.

00:40:20.080 --> 00:40:22.390
Oh, I see. You're right!

00:40:22.520 --> 00:40:24.670
Don't listen to him!

00:40:24.840 --> 00:40:26.870
So you give up?

00:40:27.000 --> 00:40:29.910
'Course I don't. You can't beat me.

00:40:30.040 --> 00:40:31.230
What?

00:40:31.560 --> 00:40:35.030
And what can you do
with a pair of shoes?

00:40:35.160 --> 00:40:40.280
A weakling like you can't protect
even the smallest ladybug!

00:40:40.680 --> 00:40:42.710
You have fire?

00:40:42.920 --> 00:40:46.830
You'll die on my thorns,
and that's that!

00:40:53.600 --> 00:40:55.670
You wondered...

00:40:57.600 --> 00:40:59.030
what I can do?

00:41:07.200 --> 00:41:08.550
He's amazing!

00:41:08.800 --> 00:41:09.940
I told you...

00:41:11.080 --> 00:41:13.540
...you'd regret what you said!

00:41:17.760 --> 00:41:19.190
Yes!

00:41:20.720 --> 00:41:22.670
Lowly idiot.

00:41:32.360 --> 00:41:35.190
Roronoa Zoro...
You have my respect.

00:41:35.880 --> 00:41:39.030
You can still stand
after my poison darts.

00:41:39.560 --> 00:41:42.200
But that is all you can do.

00:41:43.720 --> 00:41:48.310
Who cares?
I told you you can't get me.

00:41:50.240 --> 00:41:52.070
I can't afford to lose.

00:41:52.400 --> 00:41:54.110
There's no way!

00:42:01.320 --> 00:42:04.630
It's hopeless! You can't run away!

00:42:04.760 --> 00:42:07.710
Have you forgotten my stink gas?

00:42:07.920 --> 00:42:09.950
No no no no no!

00:42:10.360 --> 00:42:11.710
Say your prayers!

00:42:13.080 --> 00:42:14.470
Stop stop stop!

00:42:15.200 --> 00:42:16.390
Nooooo!

00:42:17.000 --> 00:42:18.190
Fooled ya!

00:42:18.320 --> 00:42:19.310
Powder Star!

00:42:32.480 --> 00:42:35.750
Eat that you worthless bag of filth!

00:42:38.730 --> 00:42:41.150
Gum-Gum Whip!

00:42:48.960 --> 00:42:52.190
This is actually pretty annoying.

00:43:02.960 --> 00:43:03.950
Behind you!

00:43:08.520 --> 00:43:13.590
You look pained...
But one creeps what one sows...

00:43:14.440 --> 00:43:16.310
"Reaps."

00:43:16.800 --> 00:43:18.230
You insolent!

00:43:18.360 --> 00:43:19.390
Feather darts!

00:43:23.640 --> 00:43:24.630
Amazing!

00:43:25.480 --> 00:43:30.420
Impossible! You shouldn't be
able to move from the poison!

00:43:30.680 --> 00:43:35.620
Sorry to disappoint you.
But I can't be defeated here.

00:43:35.880 --> 00:43:36.950
Hm?

00:43:37.040 --> 00:43:41.390
There's a man far away,
waiting for me to arrive.

00:43:41.520 --> 00:43:45.350
I can't be defeated until I
surpass him!

00:43:56.040 --> 00:43:57.180
Yeah!

00:44:00.640 --> 00:44:02.470
No! No way!

00:44:05.680 --> 00:44:08.140
And there we go!

00:44:10.400 --> 00:44:12.190
Ah! Let me out!

00:44:12.320 --> 00:44:13.590
Let me out!

00:44:13.920 --> 00:44:15.590
Not a chance.

00:44:20.360 --> 00:44:22.310
What's with him?

00:44:25.840 --> 00:44:26.910
Luffy!

00:44:36.720 --> 00:44:38.990
Melting Fist Special!

00:44:46.160 --> 00:44:48.270
Gum-Gum

00:44:50.000 --> 00:44:53.070
Ow! Ow! What happened?

00:44:53.360 --> 00:44:56.590
It's time to die, Rubber Boy!

00:44:56.760 --> 00:44:58.470
Bear King!

00:45:17.720 --> 00:45:18.830
Amazing...

00:45:19.560 --> 00:45:21.070
Borod!

00:45:21.440 --> 00:45:23.270
I won't miss next time.

00:45:23.400 --> 00:45:26.070
How dare you fire my cannon?

00:45:31.240 --> 00:45:32.560
Akees!

00:45:35.520 --> 00:45:37.150
Akees!

00:45:40.560 --> 00:45:45.070
Now I'm also a...
real man... of the seas..

00:45:45.360 --> 00:45:47.790
Akees!

00:45:48.880 --> 00:45:50.750
Hang on, Akees!

00:45:52.520 --> 00:45:56.030
The idiot took the bullet himself!

00:45:56.160 --> 00:46:01.910
So keen on saving others.
Petty, pathetic, stupid little kid!

00:46:03.160 --> 00:46:05.910
What did you just say?

00:46:06.320 --> 00:46:09.110
I said "pathetic stupid little kid!"

00:46:10.520 --> 00:46:12.980
I'll have you choke on that!

00:46:35.080 --> 00:46:40.070
I'll teach you what happens to
those who make a fool outta me!

00:46:41.720 --> 00:46:43.790
King Cannon will eat you!

00:46:44.080 --> 00:46:45.430
Die!

00:46:52.480 --> 00:46:53.670
What the hell?!

00:46:54.240 --> 00:46:56.910
Gum-Gum

00:46:59.540 --> 00:47:01.940
Slingshot!

00:47:35.040 --> 00:47:36.030
What...?

00:47:36.120 --> 00:47:38.470
- The island ratchet!
- Ratchet?

00:47:38.640 --> 00:47:41.200
S...something's happening!

00:47:41.360 --> 00:47:43.310
- What?
- We gotta scram!

00:47:43.440 --> 00:47:44.470
Yeah!

00:47:44.960 --> 00:47:46.100
Hey, Luffy!

00:47:46.760 --> 00:47:48.790
- Luffy!
- Luffy!

00:47:50.320 --> 00:47:51.460
Oops.

00:47:51.560 --> 00:47:53.230
The ratchet is destroyed.

00:47:53.800 --> 00:47:58.350
The whole island will collapse
before long. Are you ready?

00:47:58.480 --> 00:47:59.510
Yes.

00:47:59.600 --> 00:48:01.750
Akees! Akees!

00:48:02.880 --> 00:48:05.030
Akees... you...

00:48:05.480 --> 00:48:07.470
Are you okay?

00:48:08.080 --> 00:48:10.990
It hurts a little.

00:48:12.200 --> 00:48:13.830
You had me worried.

00:48:14.280 --> 00:48:15.390
Borod...

00:48:15.960 --> 00:48:17.030
I hear something.

00:48:28.480 --> 00:48:30.710
The Diamond Clock...

00:48:30.840 --> 00:48:34.030
It hasn't worked for years...

00:48:34.280 --> 00:48:36.710
This melody...!

00:48:37.240 --> 00:48:39.700
It's Akees' music box melody.

00:48:45.120 --> 00:48:49.150
Did... did you make that
music box, ma'am?

00:48:50.960 --> 00:48:53.520
Are... are you his...?

00:48:57.520 --> 00:48:59.750
We have no other choice!

00:49:00.280 --> 00:49:02.920
What are you doing here?

00:49:05.360 --> 00:49:10.750
Live... survive! Go where the Card
Pirates can't reach you!

00:49:12.880 --> 00:49:14.670
We could only hope...

00:49:14.800 --> 00:49:18.950
that my son... would survive.

00:49:21.960 --> 00:49:24.340
So you are his...?

00:49:26.040 --> 00:49:27.510
His mother.

00:49:30.720 --> 00:49:32.270
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:50:37.800 --> 00:50:39.550
Such irony.

00:50:40.280 --> 00:50:44.590
Our land was destroyed by the
weapon we made...

00:50:45.600 --> 00:50:48.950
It can't be helped. It was our fate.

00:50:49.080 --> 00:50:52.750
And with it goes our
seven years of pain.

00:50:53.160 --> 00:50:56.710
With our knowledge,
we can build a new island!

00:50:58.600 --> 00:50:59.670
Yes.

00:51:01.480 --> 00:51:04.550
It's the future they risked
their lives for.

00:51:05.800 --> 00:51:08.180
We must cherish it.

00:51:12.720 --> 00:51:13.710
You're bleeding.

00:51:13.840 --> 00:51:17.190
It's nothing!
I'm a man of the seas.

00:51:24.400 --> 00:51:25.430
Mom.

00:51:29.960 --> 00:51:32.670
Your hands...

00:51:33.840 --> 00:51:35.470
They're warm.

00:51:47.040 --> 00:51:48.390
Akees!

00:51:57.520 --> 00:51:59.470
Will you be okay?

00:52:00.800 --> 00:52:01.910
Yeah.

00:52:02.080 --> 00:52:07.020
He's got great parents.
It's best for him to live there.

00:52:07.160 --> 00:52:11.750
I'm used to being alone.
Actually, I'm relieved.

00:52:12.600 --> 00:52:18.750
He was just getting in my way.
And I can have the treasure for myself.

00:52:19.240 --> 00:52:21.750
Can you make it alone?

00:52:22.040 --> 00:52:24.470
A partner never hurts.

00:52:24.840 --> 00:52:27.220
Lone thieves aren't cool.

00:52:27.680 --> 00:52:30.030
I'll find one eventually.

00:52:30.160 --> 00:52:32.270
I think you already have.

00:52:32.400 --> 00:52:34.270
That's right, Borod!

00:52:34.600 --> 00:52:35.630
Akees!

00:52:35.720 --> 00:52:40.070
You can't just split!
Luckily, I'm smarter than you!

00:52:40.160 --> 00:52:42.430
But what about your parents?

00:52:42.600 --> 00:52:48.550
Don't be silly. I'm a man of the seas!
I risk my life to follow my heart!

00:52:48.840 --> 00:52:50.230
But you...

00:52:50.360 --> 00:52:53.590
We're the world's best
thief brothers, right?

00:52:55.320 --> 00:52:56.830
Akees.

00:53:02.320 --> 00:53:03.640
Yeah.

00:53:03.720 --> 00:53:07.470
Right. So we'll share this treasure
as brothers.

00:53:07.600 --> 00:53:11.270
- Correct!
- Half each? 'Cause I'm grown, now.

00:53:11.400 --> 00:53:13.070
No, seven-three!

00:53:13.200 --> 00:53:16.670
Don't be so greedy, bro!

00:53:47.200 --> 00:53:53.190
<i>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hmirai dake shinjiteru
dareka ga waratte mo kamawanai</i>

00:53:47.200 --> 00:53:53.190
<i>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hI believe in the future
And I don't care who laughs at me</i>

00:53:53.400 --> 00:53:58.630
<i>hashitteru jounetsu ga
\hanata o kirameraseru</i>

00:53:53.400 --> 00:53:58.630
<i>\h\h\hThe passion in your veins
makes the whole of you shine</i>

00:53:58.840 --> 00:54:04.590
<i>mabushi sugi, demo mitsumeteitai</i>

00:53:58.840 --> 00:54:04.590
<i>\h\hIt's too bright for my eyes
But even so I want to watch</i>

00:54:04.840 --> 00:54:11.510
<i>\h\h\h\hdokka bigaku kanjiteru
I'm really really stuck on you</i>

00:54:04.840 --> 00:54:11.510
<i>\h\h\hI sense a beauty in all this
I'm really really stuck on you</i>

00:54:11.800 --> 00:54:18.030
<i>dare ni mo nitenai yume no senaka o
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hoikakete, oikaketeku</i>

00:54:11.800 --> 00:54:18.030
<i>I'm running, following a shadow
\h\h\h\hthat looks like no one else</i>

00:54:18.200 --> 00:54:27.070
<i>Dramatic te ni ireru made
\hBelieve in Wonderland!</i>

00:54:18.200 --> 00:54:27.070
<i>Until I'll get my adventure
I'll believe in Wonderland</i>

00:54:30.480 --> 00:54:36.550
<i>dare ni mo mienai yume no katachi o
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\htsukamaete, tsukamaeteku</i>

00:54:30.480 --> 00:54:36.550
<i>I'm running, catching a dream
\h\h\hshaped as no one can see</i>

00:54:36.720 --> 00:54:42.470
<i>watashi wa tsuite yuku kara
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hatsui kimochi</i>

00:54:36.720 --> 00:54:42.470
<i>And I'll follow wherever it goes
\h\h\h\h\h\h\hMy blood pumps hot</i>

00:54:42.720 --> 00:54:48.980
<i>Tsujitsuma awase betsuni iranai
\h\h\h\h\harifureta nichijou yori mo </i>

00:54:42.720 --> 00:54:48.980
<i>\h\hI don't want excuses to adapt
I don't care for everyday norms</i>

00:54:49.160 --> 00:54:58.590
<i>Paradise mezashite hashire
\h\h\hBelieve in Wonderland!</i>

00:54:49.160 --> 00:54:58.590
<i>Aim for paradise, and run
\h\hBelieve in Wonderland!</i>
